* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
setup/DaSiWaForgeCompute.patch text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
setup/DaSiWaForgeCompute.legacy.patch text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
